Z||000011||reddog||11-03-2001||11:35 PM||||I just bought an accel coil and a igition module for my 86gt. Had the module on for less than a half an hour and it died all of the sudden. It went out accompanied buy a huge backfire and I could never get it to crank after that ( It had less than 10 miles on it). As for the coil, I haven't had any problems out of it yet but I suspect it is a piece of crap also. Anybody know of a better Ignition system that I can buy to replace this yellow SHIITE that I got robbed on. ACCEL sux!!!!!!!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sammygif.gif"> ||||reg||1
