Z||000013||tgowens||11-04-2001||02:30 AM||||Just out of curiosity, have you ever replaced your catalytic converter? If the cat clogs and then blows out it will blow into the muffler and then out the tailpipe......if it begins to run sluggish and at low power after you have changed back to the Delco coil (the best, by the way) then the cat could be the problem.......||||reg||1
Z||000014||fastback87||11-04-2001||11:22 AM||||No cat and barely a muffler after the major backfire.  She is runnin wide open and no problems yet with the original coil.||||reg||1
