Z||000021||falconhulk||11-05-2001||12:19 PM||||Yes what mary jane said.  Look up the thread.  Dont ever stick a switch across your battery!  Everyone thinks thats the way to do it. But that just shorts your battery and alternator.  wire Meltdown mess.  it takes high voltage across a spark plug to cause it to fire so you need a coil.||||reg||1
